    "What is your relationship with mathematics?":"Mathematics feels like both a tool and a puzzle for me—useful for logic but often frustrating when abstract concepts clash with concrete intuition. I enjoy solving problems creatively, especially in chemistry (as per my favorite subjects), where equations bridge theory and real-world applications.",
